{"id":"4990b18ecaa482e8","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Regular Measure Witness","display":"df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness — ZFC Measure10 Regular Measure Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness — ZFC Measure10 Regular Measure Witness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-regular-measure-witness — ZFC Measure10 Regular Measure Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,K,U,\\tau_K\\in V\">\\(\\mu,X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,K,U,\\tau_K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\cup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\cup V\\)</span> (compact-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10RegularMeasureWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10RegularMeasureWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}regular\\text{-}measure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10RegularMeasureWitness}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists K,U,\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(K\\subseteq A\\subseteq U\n\\land K\\in\\mathcal A\\land U\\in\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\tau_K=\\{O\\cap K:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_K)\n\\land\\mu(U\\setminus K)&lt;\\epsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}regular\\text{-}measure\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10RegularMeasureWitness}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists K,U,\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(K\\subseteq A\\subseteq U\n\\land K\\in\\mathcal A\\land U\\in\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{27mm}{}\\land\\tau_K=\\{O\\cap K:O\\in\\tau\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_K)\n\\land\\mu(U\\setminus K)&lt;\\epsilon\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measurable domain is an explicit sigma-algebra witness instead of the circular expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\)</span>. The compact witness uses an explicitly constructed subspace topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":